{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breaking-retry","title":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/circuit-breaking-retry","wordCount":788,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"熔断与重试-网关的故障隔离机制\">熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>熔断器（Circuit Breaker）</strong></td>\n<td>检测到后端连续故障后，停止转发请求，直接返回降级响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CLOSED 状态</strong></td>\n<td>正常转发请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OPEN 状态</strong></td>\n<td>熔断触发，直接拒绝，不访问后端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>HALF-OPEN 状态</strong></td>\n<td>试探性放行少量请求，检测后端是否恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>幂等性（Idempotency）</strong></td>\n<td>重试安全的前提：同一请求执行多次结果相同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器模式\">熔断器模式</h2><p>熔断器的灵感来自电路断路器：当电路过载时，断路器跳闸保护电路。API 网关的熔断器在检测到后端异常后，暂时&quot;断开&quot;对该后端的请求，给后端恢复时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种状态\">三种状态</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; CLOSED&#10;&#10;    CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 失败次数/率超过阈值\\n(如 5 次 5xx,或错误率 &gt; 50%)&#10;    OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 等待恢复时间窗口\\n(如 30 秒)&#10;    HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 试探请求成功&#10;    HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 试探请求仍然失败\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; CLOSED\n\n    CLOSED --&gt; OPEN: 失败次数/率超过阈值\\n(如 5 次 5xx,或错误率 &gt; 50%)\n    OPEN --&gt; HALF_OPEN: 等待恢复时间窗口\\n(如 30 秒)\n    HALF_OPEN --&gt; CLOSED: 试探请求成功\n    HALF_OPEN --&gt; OPEN: 试探请求仍然失败</pre><p><strong>CLOSED（关闭 = 正常工作）</strong>：请求正常转发，统计错误数/率。</p>\n<p><strong>OPEN（断开 = 熔断激活）</strong>：不再转发请求给后端，直接返回降级响应（503 或 fallback 数据）。避免&quot;雪崩&quot;——后端已经崩溃，继续发请求只会堆积等待队列、耗尽连接池。</p>\n<p><strong>HALF-OPEN（半开 = 试探恢复）</strong>：熔断等待时间过后，放行少量试探请求。如果成功，状态回到 CLOSED；如果还是失败，重新进入 OPEN。</p>\n<h3 id=\"envoy-熔断配置\">Envoy 熔断配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Envoy Circuit Breaker 配置&#10;circuit_breakers:&#10;  thresholds:&#10;    - priority: DEFAULT&#10;      max_connections: 1000 # 最大并发连接数&#10;      max_pending_requests: 100 # 最大排队请求数&#10;      max_requests: 1000 # 最大并发请求数&#10;      max_retries: 3 # 最大并发重试数&#10;&#10;outlier_detection:&#10;  # 离群值检测：自动摘除高错误率实例&#10;  consecutive_5xx: 5 # 连续 5 次 5xx 触发摘除&#10;  interval: 10s # 检测间隔&#10;  base_ejection_time: 30s # 首次摘除时间&#10;  max_ejection_percent: 50 # 最多摘除 50% 的实例\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Envoy Circuit Breaker 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">circuit_breakers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  thresholds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DEFAULT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_connections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大并发连接数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_pending_requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大排队请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大并发请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大并发重试数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">outlier_detection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 离群值检测：自动摘除高错误率实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  consecutive_5xx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 5 次 5xx 触发摘除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 检测间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  base_ejection_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 首次摘除时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_ejection_percent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最多摘除 50% 的实例</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"降级响应-fallback\">降级响应（Fallback）</h3><p>熔断触发时，网关有几个处理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>返回缓存数据</td>\n<td>读操作，数据可以稍旧</td>\n<td>返回 1 分钟前的商品价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回默认值</td>\n<td>推荐系统、个性化功能</td>\n<td>返回热门商品列表（非个性化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回 503</td>\n<td>核心功能，无法降级</td>\n<td>支付接口直接返回错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默忽略</td>\n<td>非关键功能（如埋点）</td>\n<td>不发事件，继续主流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 网关熔断降级伪代码&#10;func (gw *Gateway) Forward(ctx context.Context, req *Request) (*Response, error) {&#10;    cb := gw.circuitBreakers[req.Upstream]&#10;&#10;    if cb.State() == OPEN {&#10;        // 熔断中，执行降级策略&#10;        fallback := gw.fallbacks[req.Route]&#10;        if fallback != nil {&#10;            return fallback.Execute(ctx, req)&#10;        }&#10;        return nil, ErrServiceUnavailable&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    resp, err := gw.forward(ctx, req)&#10;    cb.Record(err) // 记录结果，更新熔断状态&#10;    return resp, err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 网关熔断降级伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Gateway</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gw.circuitBreakers[req.Upstream]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OPEN {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 熔断中，执行降级策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fallback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gw.fallbacks[req.Route]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrServiceUnavailable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resp, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gw.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 记录结果，更新熔断状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"重试策略\">重试策略</h2><p>重试是在请求失败时自动重发，提升成功率。但不加约束的重试会加剧问题（retry storm）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重试的前提-幂等性\">重试的前提：幂等性</h3><p>只对<strong>幂等</strong>操作重试：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>HTTP 方法</th>\n<th>幂等？</th>\n<th>是否可重试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GET</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HEAD</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DELETE</td>\n<td>是（删除已删除的资源也是成功）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PUT</td>\n<td>是（全量替换）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POST</td>\n<td>否（可能创建多份）</td>\n<td>否（除非业务层保证幂等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATCH</td>\n<td>否（增量修改）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"哪些错误应该重试\">哪些错误应该重试？</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"应该重试:&#10;  - 503 Service Unavailable（服务暂时不可用）&#10;  - 504 Gateway Timeout（上游超时）&#10;  - 连接重置（TCP RST）&#10;  - 连接超时&#10;&#10;不应该重试:&#10;  - 4xx 客户端错误（重试无意义，请求本身有问题）&#10;  - 500 Internal Server Error（可能是数据状态问题，重试可能更糟）&#10;  - 超时的 POST（不知道是否已经处理，重试有重复风险）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>应该重试:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 503 Service Unavailable（服务暂时不可用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 504 Gateway Timeout（上游超时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 连接重置（TCP RST）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 连接超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不应该重试:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 4xx 客户端错误（重试无意义，请求本身有问题）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 500 Internal Server Error（可能是数据状态问题，重试可能更糟）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 超时的 POST（不知道是否已经处理，重试有重复风险）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"指数退避-exponential-backoff\">指数退避（Exponential Backoff）</h3><p>重试之间增加等待时间，避免集中重试压垮后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func retryWithBackoff(ctx context.Context, fn func() error, maxRetries int) error {&#10;    var err error&#10;    for i := 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++ {&#10;        err = fn()&#10;        if err == nil {&#10;            return nil&#10;        }&#10;        if !isRetryable(err) {&#10;            return err // 不可重试的错误直接返回&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 指数退避 + 随机 jitter（防止所有客户端同时重试）&#10;        backoff := time.Duration(math.Pow(2, float64(i))) * 100 * time.Millisecond&#10;        jitter := time.Duration(rand.Int63n(int64(backoff / 2)))&#10;        wait := backoff + jitter&#10;&#10;        select {&#10;        case &lt;-time.After(wait):&#10;        case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;            return ctx.Err()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retryWithBackoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isRetryable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可重试的错误直接返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 指数退避 + 随机 jitter（防止所有客户端同时重试）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Millisecond</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        jitter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rand.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int63n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wait </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> backoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jitter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wait):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"envoy-重试配置\">Envoy 重试配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"retry_policy:&#10;  retry_on: &#39;5xx,reset,connect-failure,retriable-4xx&#39;&#10;  num_retries: 3&#10;  per_try_timeout: 2s # 每次重试的超时&#10;  retry_back_off:&#10;    base_interval: 100ms # 初始等待 100ms&#10;    max_interval: 5s # 最大等待 5s&#10;  host_selection_retry_max_attempts: 2 # 最多换 2 次不同实例重试\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">retry_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5xx,reset,connect-failure,retriable-4xx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  num_retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  per_try_timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每次重试的超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry_back_off</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    base_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100ms</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 初始等待 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大等待 5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host_selection_retry_max_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最多换 2 次不同实例重试</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"超时的层次\">超时的层次</h2><p>超时必须在多个层次配置，且外层超时必须大于内层（否则外层会提前放弃，内层的重试形同虚设）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端超时: 30s&#10;  → 网关总超时: 25s&#10;    → 重试最大次数: 3&#10;      → 每次请求超时: 5s&#10;        → 与后端 TCP 连接超时: 3s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端超时: 30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 网关总超时: 25s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 重试最大次数: 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      → 每次请求超时: 5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        → 与后端 TCP 连接超时: 3s</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果每次请求超时 5s，重试 3 次，总计可能等待 15s，小于网关的 25s 限制，合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>熔断器通过三态机（CLOSED→OPEN→HALF-OPEN）保护后端免受雪崩效应；重试通过指数退避配合幂等检查提升可用性，但必须严格限定可重试的错误类型。超时需要分层配置（客户端&gt;网关&gt;单次请求），保证外层不会过早放弃。这两个机制配合<a href=\"rate-limiting-throttling\">限流与节流策略</a>，构成网关弹性工程的完整体系。缓存可以进一步减少对后端的压力，见下一篇<a href=\"caching-gateway\">网关层缓存</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","id":"熔断与重试-网关的故障隔离机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器模式","id":"熔断器模式"},{"level":3,"text":"三种状态","id":"三种状态"},{"level":3,"text":"Envoy 熔断配置","id":"envoy-熔断配置"},{"level":3,"text":"降级响应（Fallback）","id":"降级响应-fallback"},{"level":2,"text":"重试策略","id":"重试策略"},{"level":3,"text":"重试的前提：幂等性","id":"重试的前提-幂等性"},{"level":3,"text":"哪些错误应该重试？","id":"哪些错误应该重试"},{"level":3,"text":"指数退避（Exponential Backoff）","id":"指数退避-exponential-backoff"},{"level":3,"text":"Envoy 重试配置","id":"envoy-重试配置"},{"level":2,"text":"超时的层次","id":"超时的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/rate-limiting-throttling"},"next":{"title":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/caching-gateway"}}